abstract: >-
  A research and educational digital-twin simulator for anatomy-aware C-arm
  positioning, scene-geometry verification, waypoint planning, deterministic
  reference radiography, and AI-assisted simulator guidance. This software is
  not a medical device and is not clinically validated.
